@baseUrl = https://localhost:7142
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### List Search Content Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trigger Universal Search Index Rebuild
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search/reindex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Authenticated Staff Spotlight Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/spotlight?q=leadership&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public CMS / Member Portal Content Search (Anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/public?q=leadership&limit=10
